    </div>
    <div>
        <p><span style="font-weight: bold">{{ nameOfInviter }}</span> has invited you to collaborate on the Shopware store <span style="font-weight: bold">{{ storeName }}</span>.</p>
        <p>To get access to the store, please either log in or sign up using the email address <span style="font-weight: bold">{{ invitedEmailAddress }}</span>.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding-top: 25px;">
        <a href="{{ signupUrl }}" style="border: 1px solid; border-radius: 5px; background: #0870FF; color: #fff; padding:10px 15px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9em; font-weight:bold;">Get started</a>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
', '{{ nameOfInviter }} has invited you to collaborate on the Shopware store {{ storeName }}.

To get access to the store, please either log in or sign up using the email address {{ invitedEmailAddress }}.

{{ signupUrl }}
', NULL, '2026-11-24 08:53:23.941', NULL);
